{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"nav","type":"text","text":"# BossAI｜结构图\nKevin 正式 P3 单机 BT、11 攻击入口、两阶段、真实落地和死亡清理已验；完整 Dash_F 追击另有复验。历史强制重入矩阵、联机／Cook 和完整换形态事务未覆盖。\n[[BossAI/结构|结构文档]] · [[GGYGO_流程_BossAI.canvas|主流程]] · [[GGYGO_流程_Boss选招.canvas|选招]] · [[GGYGO_流程_Boss换形态.canvas|换形态目标]]","x":0,"y":0,"width":1520,"height":175,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"definition","type":"text","text":"## UGGYGOBossDefinition / ActionSet\nDefinition 提供 Form/Phase 与动作池。\nValidateConfiguration(OutError) → 全集 Tag/类/数值校验；IsDataValid 复用。\n坏行整集拒绝，空集/全基础零合法。\n[[计划_BOSSAI]]","x":0,"y":250,"width":410,"height":300,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"encounter","type":"text","text":"## AGGYGOBossEncounter\nbool SpawnBoss() → 仅Authority生成；拒绝已有对象、装配/清理重入及EndPlay后生成。\n前提：EditInstanceOnly属性BossDefinition已配置，Definition不是函数参数。\nGetBossState/Avatar/Controller → 查询装配成功的公开引用。\nCreatedBossState/Controller/Avatar → 弱创建责任，独立于Owner/当前Avatar。\nprotected EndPlay / CleanupCreatedBoss → 失败/撤场共用幂等回收；外部Avatar只解绑，不销毁。\n14b完整构建/两专项通过；真实BT/PIE/联机待验。","x":0,"y":620,"width":410,"height":365,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"state","type":"text","text":"## AGGYGOBossState : AGGYGOCombatantState\nInitializeFromDefinition(Data) → 授予全形态能力、初始标签。\nGetCurrentFormTag / GetCurrentPhaseTag → 复制状态查询。\n继承AttachAvatar(NewPawn) / DetachAvatar(ExpectedPawn) → 权威绑定/身份安全解绑。\n持久ASC与Avatar引用归宿主；释放与ActorInfo归宿主，PawnExtension广播Ready/Released。\n[[Combatants/结构|宿主接口]]","x":540,"y":250,"width":440,"height":330,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"avatar","type":"text","text":"## AGGYGOBossCharacter\n`GetMeleeTraceComponent()` → GA 开关判定窗口。\nPawnExtension 绑定 BossState ASC；Mesh/CMC/碰撞属于当前形态 Pawn。","x":540,"y":640,"width":440,"height":240,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"controller","type":"text","text":"## AGGYGOBossAIController\nSelectAction → 耗尽恢复/确定性抽签。\nStore/ConsumeActionSelection → 弱来源身份，一次消费原Spec。\nClearActionSelection → 清失效请求。\n持有BrainComponent；GetBrainComponent供Encounter请求StopLogic。\nUnPossess → 解除Pawn；换Avatar只PauseLogic。\n请求/派生权重归AI，冷却与执行归GAS。","x":1100,"y":250,"width":420,"height":370,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"tasks","type":"text","text":"## BT 与原 GAS\nChooseBossAction 筛选并存原 Spec。\nActivateAbility 先订阅 OnAbilityEnded\n再 TryActivateAbility；结束只清本等待。\nKevin Face→Choose→Activate→Wait；\n完整 Dash_F 能力追击，不含 MoveTo。\n[[BossAI/计划_Kevin_DemonBattle战斗接入]]","x":1100,"y":630,"width":420,"height":300,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ga","type":"text","text":"## Boss GA 与蓝图流程\nMeleeAbility 持 Original／Task／Owned Trace／Motion，final 入口仍归 GA／ASC。\nAttackAbility 给 BP 原 Token：\nBindBossTarget → 原目标订阅；\nExecuteBossWindow → 近战／范围／弹体；\nAcquire／ReleaseBossFlight → CMC；\nWaitBossLanding → 真实 Landed；\nPlayBossRecoveryPresentation → 纯表现；\nFinish／FailBossAction → 原终止请求。\n地面／飞行／死亡编排只在 BP。\nCleanup 先摘原批次，再归还自有资源；\nCombat 查询，GA 构造 GE／Cue，GAS 结算。\n[[BossAI/计划_Kevin_DemonBattle战斗接入|输入、输出和清理]]","x":1100,"y":1000,"width":420,"height":480,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"future","type":"text","text":"## BP 阶段与目标\nKevin BTS 获取／失去目标；State BP 消费\n生命事实并在 50% 调 SetCurrentPhase。\n单形态两阶段已验。多形态 Pawn 替换\n仍是目标：[[GGYGO_流程_Boss换形态.canvas]]","x":540,"y":1050,"width":440,"height":230,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"contract","type":"text","text":"## 状态归属与当前验证\nEncounter 装配与销毁创建对象；State 持 ASC／Form／Phase；Controller 持 Brain、Focus 和一次选择。\nKevin 顶层目标、阶段、地面／飞行／死亡流程由 BP／BT／资产决定；原生 AttackAbility 只提供原资源操作。\nGA／ASC 唯一生命周期，Animation 发布姿态和窗，CMC 执行胶囊，Combat 查询去重，GAS 结算。\nKevin 正式单机战斗、阶段、两条空中真实落地和死亡清理已验；Dash_F 及主要表现受影响复验通过。\n历史强制重入 B1、逐时点中断矩阵、联机／Cook、性能及设备试听仍未覆盖。\n[[BossAI/计划_Kevin_DemonBattle战斗接入|完整接口／来源／证据]] · [[Movement/结构|Flying 借还]] · [[Combat/结构|范围与弹体]]","x":0,"y":1550,"width":1450,"height":330,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"motion-profile","type":"text","text":"## Movement｜Profile动作接缝\nGA BeginOriginalMeleeMotion\n(Original, CMC, Profile, Rate)\n→ 调BeginActionMotion，保存原Handle。\nObserveActionMotionFailure\n(Handle, Callback, Error)\n→ CMC持唯一原资源观察，返回注册结果。\n失败回调原Handle/Reason → GA FailOriginalAction。\n闭包固定原批次/弱CMC/句柄，不借后继。\nRequestAbilityEnd(Original,true,true)\n→ GAS判原End资格，保留Cancelled事实。\nEndActionMotion(原Handle) → 退原源/观察；\nGA归还句柄，CMC唯一执行/注销。\n地面水平Profile是正常模式，Z排除；\n非法配置明确失败，无Profile完成信号。\n[[Movement/结构|CMC]] · [[Movement/动作曲线执行|动作模式契约]]","x":1660,"y":1000,"width":580,"height":480,"color":"4"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e1","fromNode":"definition","fromSide":"right","toNode":"state","toSide":"left","label":"初始化 Form / Phase 与能力"},
		{"id":"e2","fromNode":"encounter","fromSide":"right","toNode":"state","toSide":"left","label":"创建并记录责任；调用初始化 / DetachAvatar"},
		{"id":"e3","fromNode":"encounter","fromSide":"right","toNode":"avatar","toSide":"left","label":"创建初始Avatar；保留回收责任"},
		{"id":"e4","fromNode":"encounter","fromSide":"right","toNode":"controller","toSide":"left","label":"创建；调用Possess/UnPossess；查询Brain"},
		{"id":"e5","fromNode":"state","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"avatar","toSide":"top","label":"Attach/Detach经PawnExtension绑定/解绑"},
		{"id":"e6","fromNode":"controller","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"tasks","toSide":"top","label":"驱动 BT 任务"},
		{"id":"e7","fromNode":"tasks","fromSide":"right","toNode":"ga","toSide":"left","label":"经ASC TryActivateAbility请求；订阅OnAbilityEnded等待"},
		{"id":"e8","fromNode":"ga","fromSide":"left","toNode":"avatar","toSide":"right","label":"作用于原Mesh/Trace/CMC；Context归还原资源"},
		{"id":"e9","fromNode":"future","fromSide":"top","toNode":"state","toSide":"bottom","label":"目标：转阶段更新持久状态"},
		{"id":"e-ga-profile","fromNode":"ga","fromSide":"right","toNode":"motion-profile","toSide":"left","label":"原Profile/速率→Handle；注册观察及精确清理"},
		{"id":"e-profile-failure","fromNode":"motion-profile","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"ga","toSide":"bottom","label":"原Handle/Reason→FailOriginalAction请求Cancelled End"}
	]
}
